    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But boredom is essential to childhood development. It sparks imagination and builds up inner emotional resources. It’s a",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15288
        },
        {
          "text": "When children no longer have the experience of boredom, they lose an occasion to stretch themselves in new directions",
          "ok": true,
