      "words": 48
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Pets are authentically what they are",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17591
        },
        {
          "text": "But when relational artifacts say they care, they are pretending to be something they are not. When we allow them this t",
